WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:04.604
&gt;&gt; AND NOW A MESSAGE FROM
AMAZON'S CEO JEFF BEZOS.

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HI, EVERYONE.
AS YOU KNOW, AMAZON JUST

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.441
ANNOUNCED THE LOCATION OF ITS
TWO NEW HEADQUARTERS IN NEW YORK

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:16.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND VIRGINIA.
AND EVERYONE, EXCEPT FOR THE

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:19.319
PEOPLE WHO LIVE THERE AND THE
PEOPLE WHO LIVE IN ALL OF THE

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:22.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
PLACES WE DIDN'T CHOOSE, IS
THRILLED.

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.591
SOME FOLKS HAVE SPECULATED THAT
I WAS SOMEHOW TROLLING

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.893
PRESIDENT TRUMP BY BUILDING ONE
HEADQUARTERS IN HIS HOMETOWN OF

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:29.829
QUEENS AND THE OTHER IN HIS
CURRENT RESIDENCE OF WASHINGTON,

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:35.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
D.C., THEREBY OVERSHADOWING OR
HUMILIATING HIM.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:39.039
BUT THAT'S SIMPLY NOT TRUE.
SURE, HE ATTACKED ME REPEATEDLY

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:43.610
ON TWITTER, BUT I CHOSE OUR NEW
LOCATIONS BECAUSE THEY WERE

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:45.011
IDEAL FOR A GROWING BUSINESS,
NOT JUST TO MAKE DONALD TRUMP

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:49.916
THINK ABOUT HOW I'M LITERALLY
100 TIMES RICHER THAN HE IS.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:55.755
WE NEEDED ACCESS TO A YOUNG,
EDUCATED WORKFORCE, WHICH IS WHY

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:58.358
WE SET UP A SATELLITE OFFICE IN
PALM BEACH, FLORIDA, ACROSS THE

00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:03.229 size:84% position:42%
STREET FROM MAR-A-LAGO.
AND DID I PURCHASE "THE

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:05.331 align:start size:94% position:6%
WASHINGTON POST"?
SURE.

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:08.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUT IT WASN'T JUST TO RUN
HEADLINES LIKE THE WHITE HOUSE

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:14.674
IS IN A MELTDOWN OR LAWYERS
SUING "THE APPRENTICE" FOR

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:16.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
PRESIDENT TRUMP'S USE OF THE
N-WORD.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:18.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND I ALSO LIKE THE STYLE
SECTION.

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:21.147
BUT THE REAL REASON I WANTED TO
TALK TO YOU TODAY HAS NOTHING TO

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:23.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
DO WITH DONALD TRUMP, WHO
PUBLICLY ATTACKED OUR COMPANY

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:30.090
FOR EXPLOITING THE POST OFFICE.
I'M HERE TO ANNOUNCE A BRAND-NEW

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:34.127
DELIVERY OPTION THAT DOESN'T
INVOLVE THE POST OFFICE AT ALL,

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:35.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
AMAZON CARAVAN.
ANY PACKAGE GOING TO TRUMP'S

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:41.167
BUILDING WILL GET DELIVERED BY
HUNDREDS OF HONDURAN IMMIGRANTS

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:44.270
AND I WILL PICK UP THE BILL.
UNLESS YOU ORDER THIS BOOK,

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.606
BECAUSE THAT COSTS MORE I GUESS
IT'S HEAVIER.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:53.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
I GUESS THAT'S THE ONLY BOOK
WITH FOUR CHAPTER 11S.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.783
TESTING HAS SHOWN CUSTOMERS FIND
DRONES SCARY AND IMPERSONAL.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:02:00.086
THAT'S WHY I'M OUTFITTING EACH
AND EVERY DRONE WITH HUMAN HAIR.

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:02.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
THE STYLE OF THE HAIR WAS
COMPLETELY RANDOM.

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:05.959
I JUST WANTED SOMETHING THAT
LOOKED SO SILLY AND EVERYBODY

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.995
KNEW IT WAS FAKE AND THE DROVE
SHOULD JUST GIVE UP AND SHAVE

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:12.565
HIS HEAD LIKE A REAL MAN WOULD.
AND I WANT TO MAKE SURE TO GIVE

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:14.834
BACK TO THE NEW COMMUNITIES FOR
JOINING.

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:18.138
THAT'S WHY I'M PURCHASING A
BUILDING IN QUEENS THAT USED TO

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:21.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
BE THE CROWN JEWEL OF FRED
TRUMP'S REAL ESTATE EMPIRE AND

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:23.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
CONVERTING IT INTO PUBLIC
URINALS.

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:27.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND IN VIRGINIA, WE'LL BE VERY
CLOSE TO ARLINGTON NATIONAL

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:31.851
CEMETERY SO WE CAN PAY OUR
RESPECT TO FALLEN VETERANS, EVEN

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:35.455
WHEN IT'S RAINING OUTSIDE.
THANKS TO MR. TRUMP, AMAZON'S

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:41.227
FUTURE IS BRIGHTER THAN EVER.
&gt;&gt; THIS HAS BEEN A SICKBURN BY

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:44.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
JEFF BEZOS.

